* LVS reference for e2_leak (layout/e2/e2gen.py): E2 leakage test cell, MIL-362
.subckt e2_leak vdd vss vreset abus vbn_prb grp_en en_a en_b rsel sub
XMFA vdd na pa vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=2u
XMEA pa en_a sa vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XMBA sa vbn_prb vss vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=2u
XMBB sb vbn_prb vss vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=2u
XMEB pb en_b sb vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XMFB vdd nb pb vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=2u
XSCA pa en_a mca vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSWA mca rsel ma vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSBA ma sub abus vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSBB mb sub abus vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSWB mcb rsel mb vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSCB pb en_b mcb vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSA vreset grp_en na vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.5u
XSB1 vreset grp_en mid vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.5u
XSB2 mid grp_en nb vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.5u
XPC vreset grp_en mid vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XCA vss na vss vss nfet_03v3 W=8.56u L=5.84u
XCB vss nb vss vss nfet_03v3 W=8.56u L=5.84u
.ends e2_leak
